      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T11:52:27Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, proxy creation receipt, complete Upgraded(address) log range from block 20305978 through the exploit block, pre-exploit implementation hash, pinned reproduction, and Verichains analysis. The exploit calls CvxRewardDistributor proxy 0x2b083beaac310cc5e190b1d2507038ccb03e7606, which delegates claimMultipleStaking to 0x47c69e8c909ce626af73c955a5e34a20b7c71f19. Its sole pre-exploit Upgraded event is creation log 31 and selects that implementation. The unvalidated caller-supplied staking contract inflated the CVG claim. The exploit receipt records 60.058285738671884767 WETH and 15925.234299672041310152 crvFRAX transferred from the swap pools to the attacker; Verichains reports approximately $210,000."
